# OKF bundle
*.bak
.DS_Store

# Local tmux session layout — not part of the bundle.
.tmuxp.yml

# Playwright MCP scratch output (console logs, page snapshots) — never part of the bundle.
.playwright-mcp/

# OKF caches and per-bundle gate state: third-party page text and fingerprints, evidence for
# local checks and never part of the product. The hook refuses a tracked file here. Knowledge ADR-0004.
/.okf/cache/
